      "sourceTextSha256": "36d5a1940e5316d55333b14ac7877123fe4761c7a805af569146fcf6b567e058",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival in Rio de Janeiro and transfer to the hotel. If you arrive before dusk, the road from the airport reveals green hills, rocky mountains, palm trees and beautiful bays; at nightfall, the lights of the hillside neighbourhoods surround the city like a shimmering necklace. Between palm trees, sand, ocean waves and a cold coconut water, you are in one of the most beautiful and exotic cities in the world.",
